cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this project, please cite it as below."
title: "INFO 521: Machine Learning Foundations — Course Project"
abstract: >-
  Student-facing materials for the INFO 521 course project, at the
  University of Arizona College of Information Science: a single clinical
  dataset (NHANES 2021-2022) worked through two parts and nine milestone
  notebooks, from least squares and maximum likelihood through approximate
  Bayesian inference, classification, and unsupervised methods. Includes
  the shared data-loading and plotting package and the grading criteria.
  Reference solutions are held in a private repository and are not
  included here. Companion repository to the INFO 521 course hub.
